        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[김수영 시에 나타난 실존주의적 전망의 긍정성]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[The Positivity of Existentialistic Perspective Represented in Kim SooYoung’s Poems]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[The Positivity of Existentialistic Perspective Represented in Kim SooYoung’s Poems]]></article-title>
